description.narrative:
Målen för insatsen är;
-ökad demokratisk representation, ökat deltagande och inflytande för unga kvinnor och män inom politiken, som ämnar främja bättre levnadsvillkor för människorna i programländerna.
-att ungdomars och kvinnliga fullmäktigeledamöters effektiva deltagande och inflytande på lokal myndighetsnivå har ökat, samt; 
-förbättrad kapacitet hos politiska aktörer med demokratiska värderingar genom att öka deras representativitet och förmåga att samordna krafter för att möta demokratiska utmaningar.

The aims for the contribution are;
-increased democratic representation, participation and influence of young women and men within politics, who aim to promote better living conditions for the people in the programme countries;
-that the effective participation and influence of  youth and women councillors in local government level has increased, and; 
-improved capabilities of politcial actors committed to democratic values by increasing their representativeness and capacity to coordinate forces to face democratic challenges.

Målen för insatsen är;
1.Increased democratic representation, participation and influence of young women and men within politics, that aim to promote better living conditions for the people in the programme countries;
2. The effective participation and influence of LCV (LC5) youth and women councillors in local government level has increased
3 Improve the capabilities of political actors committed to democratic values by increasing their representativeness and capacity to coordinate forces to face democratic challenges in the region
4 To improve the capabilities of sister parties and political organisations to increase their internal democracy, promote dialogue with other like-minded actors, and increase their capacity to formulate more inclusive policies
